    "body": "Well, maybe. In #6315, scheduled to land on Monday, we're largely replacing the top-level browsing context concept with \"top-level traversable\". What you've provided is a good list of specs that we'll need to help you all update.\r\n\r\nI'll add in the export to that PR, and in particular I'll ensure \"create a new top-level traversable\"'s arguments are both optional.",
